OL,3,GNEWSABradford 10k to return with new
OL,4,Aorganisers
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Bradford 10k is returning to the
OL,7,Fcity next year with a new organiser
OL,8,Fafter this year's event did not go
OL,9,Fahead.
OL,11,FJane Tomlinson's Run For All will take
OL,12,Fover from Epilepsy Action, the charity
OL,13,Fwhich delivered the race for 18 years.
OL,15,FThe 10k will keep the same city centre
OL,16,Froute but has moved from its past slot
OL,17,Fin June to become a winter race on
OL,18,FSunday February 28.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
